title: Authorizations › New case › Agents work › An agent could not finish
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 3 of 4, 'Agents work')
intro: Verify cannot reach Cardinal's portal the first time a case for Cardinal runs. The row says 'Could not finish' and the run holds until the person chooses 'Retry' or 'Skip and note'. Retry works. Skip adds a warning to Review and sign and a note to the request's history.
dir: TD
also: Trigger, no hidden step: any new case whose payer is Cardinal Health Plan. Pull the EMR Connect chart L.G., 29 (Cardinal), or pick Cardinal under 'Payer and plan', then Continue and 'Start the agents'. Other payers never fail. Cases opened from a request on the case page never fail either.
---
start s1 "Verify's turn, second of ten\nThe run has reached the coverage check"
decision dPay "Is the payer Cardinal Health Plan?\nAnd has this case never had a Retry or a Skip"
process pOk "Verify answers: 'Coverage is active and prior authorization is required'"
ext xPortal "Cardinal's provider portal (demo: simulated)\nDoes not answer"
agent aV "Verify tries for about 0.6 seconds, then stops"
screen sFail "Row 'Verify': pill 'Could not finish'\n'Could not reach Cardinal's portal. Coverage is not confirmed yet'\nButtons 'Retry' and 'Skip and note'\nThe nine agents behind it show 'Waiting'"
process pHold "The run holds\nFooter hint: 'Verify could not finish. Retry it, or skip it and note it.'\nCase Manager row and the Dashboard note: 'Verify could not reach Cardinal's portal. Retry it or skip it'\nThe case counts as needing a person"

click cRetry "Click 'Retry'"
store stRetry "Failure cleared\nThe draft remembers that Verify has been retried, so a later run of this case does not fail again"
agent aV2 "Verify runs its step again and answers"
goto gRun "Continues in: Agents work › Start the run and watch it"

click cSkip "Click 'Skip and note'"
store stSkip "Verify counts as done and is marked skipped\nRow: pill 'Skipped and noted'\n'Skipped. Cardinal's portal could not be reached, so coverage is not confirmed'"
process pAfter "The other nine agents run as usual"
goto gReview "Continues in: Review and sign › Validation summary and checks"
toast tWarn "Review and sign, Checks: 'Request has no errors' warns\n'Verify could not reach Cardinal's portal, so coverage was not confirmed. You skipped it and noted it.'\nSigning needs the acknowledgement tick-box"
store stNote "After Sign and send, the request's history says\n'Verify could not reach Cardinal's portal before signing'\n'Coverage was not confirmed. You skipped it and noted it.'"
goto gSign "Continues in: New case › Review and sign › Sign and send"

click cLeave "Leave the page, or click 'Back'"
process pStay "The draft keeps the failure\nOpening it again shows the same row"
click cOther "Records change before Retry (any intake edit)"
process pReset "The run starts over\nThe failure is gone and Verify tries again; if Retry was already used it passes"
goto gRec "Continues in: Medical records › The checklist and Continue"

s1 --> dPay
dPay -->|No| pOk --> gRun
dPay -->|Yes| xPortal --> aV --> sFail --> pHold
pHold --> cRetry --> stRetry --> aV2 --> gRun
pHold --> cSkip --> stSkip --> pAfter --> tWarn --> stNote --> gSign
pAfter --> gReview
pHold --> cLeave --> pStay
pHold --> cOther --> pReset --> gRec
